Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.39,0:00:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:18.09,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.27,0:00:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of deception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:46.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate the face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,when our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,on your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.47,0:01:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:14.43,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:35.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hear me, those of you without even a name!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:38.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We, the Individual Eleven,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.36,0:01:40.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,who have gathered while remaining disparate,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.36,0:01:42.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,will reform the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.56,0:01:48.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This nation is about to end as a system.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.36,0:01:51.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Suicide bombings by refugees,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.46,0:01:52.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,faltering politics,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.96,0:01:54.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and conflicts with other nations...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.46,0:02:00.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Individualists that form a complex entity shall\Nrescue this nation from these circumstances!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.16,0:02:03.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Awaken, those without even a name!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:06.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Become one with the system!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:11.18,Sign - Copy,,450,0,500,,{\b1}Face{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.11,0:02:17.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We declare... on the refugees...\Nand with it... To liberation!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:15.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Hey, audio! Is this going out on the seven o'clock news?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.31,0:02:17.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Is it?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:19.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Okay, we'll be sending over footage.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:21.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sugi-Chan, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:26.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Today, we shall rise again for the final time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:35.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Carry on your will!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.71,0:02:36.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:37.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't waste your breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:41.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}OH MY GOD!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.10,0:02:44.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}They cut off... each other's heads...\Nwith their swords!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.80,0:02:47.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}One after the other... Th... they're fighting!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:49.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}It's an unbelievable sight!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.80,0:02:52.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}The men who appeared on the\Nbuilding's rooftop seem to have...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:52.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Pause the video.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.70,0:02:54.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is the footage of the Individual Eleven,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:59.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,who appeared suddenly at the\Nstate-run broadcast station.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:03.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just after they appeared, they committed suicide, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:07.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Their actions bring to mind what we concluded\Nafter profiling Gouda's virtual persona.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:13.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The imagination of those acting as the\Nmedium causes the stand alone complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:17.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The birth of a hero is complete with his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.70,0:03:23.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Their actions follow Sylvestre's words to the\Nletter in his discussion of the Cuban Revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:29.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Gouda was nice enough to fabricate the illusory\Nwork called the "Individual Eleven,"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.40,0:03:32.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,not to mention that he cleverly camouflaged\Nthe fact that it was a virus by doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.40,0:03:36.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In addition to the reporter I visited,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:41.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,there should be a lot more mysterious\Nsuicides around the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:43.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I guess I had a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:49.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It is certain that those who\Nare infected with the virus
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:52.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,become programmed to\Ncommit suicide in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:59.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The refugees are already taking\Naction by committing suicide bombings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:04.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,While it is unclear how many copycats\Nwill emerge as a result of this broadcast,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.28,0:04:06.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,many civilians, who were\Nunaware of the refugee problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:13.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,are now acutely aware of this powder\Nkeg's existence in this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:17.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In order to prevent further\Ninfections by this virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:18.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,a vaccine is essential.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:23.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's likely that Gouda's plan has\Nonly completed its first stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.48,0:04:27.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Although the response by refugees\Nand copycats is of some concern,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:31.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,being at a numerical disadvantage, Section 9 can\Nno longer deal effectively with the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:35.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Consequently, we will focus our efforts\Non the Cabinet Intelligence Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.38,0:04:39.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In order to do so, we must capture that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.31,0:04:41.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.51,0:04:43.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But who the hell is this guy, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:46.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why was he the only one\Nwho didn't commit suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.21,0:04:48.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That is impossible to determine with any accuracy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.01,0:04:52.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,until we analyse his cyberbrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.91,0:04:54.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The ID team has decided to call those
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.71,0:04:57.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,who have been infected by the same virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:05:01.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,yet act in an entirely different\Nmanner, "sporadic anomalies."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:07.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, have you been able to discern\Nany new information from the footage?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:08.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:10.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,First, please see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:14.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We had already noted this in the footage\Nof the attack on the Prime Minister,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.81,0:05:17.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but when he speaks,\Nhe doesn't move his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.91,0:05:18.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.51,0:05:19.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Eliminate!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.31,0:05:26.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At the time, we believed he was cutting off his facial\Nneural network to improve his body's performance,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.17,0:05:22.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Eliminate!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.20,0:05:24.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Eliminate!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.91,0:05:25.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Eliminate!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:29.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but since the same behaviour\Nwas observed in this incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:31.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,a different conclusion has emerged.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.90,0:05:32.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:34.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}Enough talk!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:43.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems he is not using\Nmost of the micro machines
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.73,0:05:45.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that constitute his mimetic\Nmuscles' neural network.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.03,0:05:47.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As in, his mouth won't move?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.03,0:05:50.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, not that it won't move,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.23,0:05:52.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but rather that he can barely move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.73,0:05:55.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And that's a lead that'll help us get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:56.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't be impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:05:59.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,With that in mind,\Nplease look at this face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.93,0:06:03.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He has a pretty good face, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:05.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who gives a damn about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:07.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You people are so impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.83,0:06:09.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listen to me for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.13,0:06:10.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What I'm trying to say is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.73,0:06:17.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,why does he have such a human face, when\Nhe has omitted so many mimetic muscles?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:21.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He had a skilled face maker create his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.83,0:06:23.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well done, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.83,0:06:28.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This guy's face was probably\Nmade by a top-notch face maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:33.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My guess is that it was made by an artist who\Nisn't being sponsored by a large corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:38.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If those are the criteria,\Nonly two matches exist in this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:47.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'd never have guessed that\Nface makers were so valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:49.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's been said that Japanese\Npeople have very good dexterity,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.94,0:06:52.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but are not terribly skilled\Nat creating realistic objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.61,0:06:55.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In reality, only a few artists\Nare talented enough to create
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:06:58.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,one-of-a-kind faces, even if they\Nare able to make generic ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.81,0:06:59.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.26,0:07:03.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:11.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:13.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.17,0:07:15.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sir! It seems to be a homicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.17,0:07:18.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:20.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sounds like something\Nstrange is going on already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:21.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.57,0:07:23.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Our target may have already been eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.87,0:07:25.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're already a step ahead of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:29.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't know, but the prefectural police have\Nsealed off his studio, due to a homicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:31.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll send Pazu and Saitou.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.27,0:07:33.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't let the prefectural\Npolice disturb the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.47,0:07:35.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It may be too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.85,0:07:37.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.65,0:07:41.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Could we ask that you leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.65,0:07:42.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:46.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why would Section 9 show\Nup for a simple homicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:48.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is the victim a face maker?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.75,0:07:49.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:53.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He was a very important witness\Nfor a case we were investigating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.45,0:07:54.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, that's too bad for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.05,0:07:57.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This case will get solved in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.85,0:08:02.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll hand over the information once\Nthe killer is caught, so just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:03.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:04.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.15,0:08:07.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It doesn't take an ID team\Nmember to figure out right away
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.95,0:08:09.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,whether or not you can get fingerprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:12.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In addition, the killer knew the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They were drinking together\Nright before the crime occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:21.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Furthermore, the killer's face was\Nrecorded by that security camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:25.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sure we don't need to explain further.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:27.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let us see that footage, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.72,0:08:28.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry, can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:29.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:33.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We can take away your\Njurisdiction by force, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:35.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We won't bow under that kind of pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:37.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is {\i1}our{\i} case.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:39.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, Batou.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:43.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not too peaceful around here, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.53,0:08:52.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That face...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.43,0:08:57.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:09.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's definitely Pazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.23,0:09:12.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What happened with the\Nfingerprint evidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:14.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They matched Pazu's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.53,0:09:16.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The lip print from the\Ndrink glass also matched.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:21.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It took some work to stop the prefectural\Npolice, since they are yelling for an arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.63,0:09:25.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sure that even they understand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.33,0:09:27.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that this footage alone doesn't\Nconstitute decisive evidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.03,0:09:30.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but now that both the fingerprints and the\Nlip print match, things are complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.18,0:09:34.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even those two can be fabricated, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.73,0:09:38.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If the DNA data of his cybernetic\Nbody was also stolen, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.93,0:09:41.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Supposing that the cyborg is behind this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:43.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,would something like this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.43,0:09:45.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:47.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It could be that this case\Ncoincided with a different incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:50.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Pazu, do you have any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:53.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,None at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.52,0:09:54.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:59.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa and Bomer, investigate whether a record\Nof that male cyborg exists in the collected data.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:01.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou, Saitou and Togusa,\Ncooperate with the prefectural police
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.02,0:10:04.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and follow the lead in the face maker homicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:07.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Pazu, lie low until you're cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:11.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Report any information you can think of\Nif you believe it's pertinent to the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.42,0:10:13.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There has to be some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.65,0:10:15.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:24.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.57,0:10:27.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Haven't you thought of\Nanything that might be related?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:29.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, I haven't thought of anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:33.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If it's hard for you to tell the\NMajor, you can tell me, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:35.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you think of anything, talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.67,0:10:37.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.39,0:10:49.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're a pair of death masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.79,0:10:52.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's the owner's new taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.99,0:10:55.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:10:57.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll have what he's having.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.09,0:11:03.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you have a question for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.59,0:11:07.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, I thought I'd tail you,\Nbut I felt you'd notice right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.69,0:11:14.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't really think you're\Nthe one who did it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.69,0:11:19.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After all, people who have cybernetic\Nfaces are nothing new in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.39,0:11:23.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But that face wasn't just a face\Nthat was identical to yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.29,0:11:25.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It really {\i1}was{\i} you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.79,0:11:30.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,From the footage,\NI felt obsession directed at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:33.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The killer definitely has\Nsome connection to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.49,0:11:36.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's why I'll be keeping\Na close watch on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.69,0:11:38.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I came tonight to tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:39.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.71,0:11:50.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is the first time\Nyou've had male company.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.01,0:11:52.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,For the most part, you're alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.91,0:11:55.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,or with a different woman every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.91,0:11:57.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He was just some guy I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.01,0:12:01.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did your tastes change?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.61,0:12:03.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, you're talking about the masks?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.31,0:12:10.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I recently got to know a very\Nnice artist who is a face maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.91,0:12:11.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A face maker?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.41,0:12:16.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I decided to ask him to create my new face,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.91,0:12:19.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but when I was trying on the faces he made,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.71,0:12:21.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I realised something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.81,0:12:22.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.71,0:12:25.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,one's ghost perhaps doesn't reside in one's\Ncybernetic cranial core, but in one's skin,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.66,0:12:30.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and in the wrinkles of one's face in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.66,0:12:33.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The face maker was making new faces for soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.06,0:12:39.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,who were wounded,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:40.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but at one point,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:46.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,he apparently realised that the soldier was\Npsychologically damaged as deeply as the wound
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:47.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,on the soldier's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:15.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, it's you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:22.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:24.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No way...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.48,0:13:31.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Isn't it this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:34.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I found him, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:37.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,His name is Kuze Hideo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.58,0:13:39.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He is a complete cyborg.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:44.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,From the recorded specs, it's pretty certain\Nthat he's using a PKF-spec cyborg body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:46.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As for the face,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:48.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,just as the identification team surmised,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.38,0:13:51.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it is nearly devoid of neural networks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.58,0:13:56.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems to have its expression and wrinkles\Nexpressed through the face maker's skills alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:13:58.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As expected, it's one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:14:01.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The material used is a nanocarbon\Nand artificial skin hybrid
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.68,0:14:05.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that has a self-regeneration routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:06.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:09.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't know if there is a direct connection,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.48,0:14:15.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but the deceased face maker seems to have preferred\Nto create faces for retired military personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.48,0:14:22.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This guy probably heard about the rumour\Nand had the face maker create his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:24.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, "Kuze Hideo"...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:27.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Since the records have been erased,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:29.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we have no choice but to trace his\Nfootsteps through a direct investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:32.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa, get ready to\Nfly over to the Peninsula.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.18,0:14:35.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's a bit tough on my old bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:38.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, you're the one with the most connections over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:42.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wonder if he has anything to\Ndo with the face maker's murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:43.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.28,0:14:48.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, the killer has\Nsome connection to Pazu...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.18,0:14:48.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:51.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It could be something about a\Nwoman, surprisingly enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.54,0:14:55.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, we're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.44,0:14:56.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:14:58.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A detective with the prefectural police was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.74,0:15:04.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He met with Pazu right before he was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:05.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is Pazu there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.54,0:15:06.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.24,0:15:11.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, someone's clearly trying to frame Pazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.04,0:15:13.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,From the shell casing on the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.64,0:15:17.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's been determined that the ammunition is exclusive to the Seburo M-5.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:19.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's pretty blatant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.14,0:15:22.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Pazu, you still don't have any idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.44,0:15:23.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's more like I have too many ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:30.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, show me the murdered face maker's clientele\Nlist, starting from the most recent client.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.74,0:15:33.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I may think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.73,0:15:34.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.63,0:15:35.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bomer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.19,0:15:47.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, let me handle this\Ncase alone from this point on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.29,0:15:50.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If it seems like I'll\Ninconvenience Section 9 in any way,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.79,0:15:52.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't care if you cut me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.69,0:15:57.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If I'm right, this is an extremely...\Npersonal...matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.69,0:16:00.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood. Do what you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.89,0:16:02.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.43,0:16:10.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.23,0:16:14.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What're you guys getting\Nthe wrong idea for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.53,0:16:17.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you saying that he's the suspect?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.23,0:16:19.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,From circumstantial evidence, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.73,0:16:21.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But he's innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.73,0:16:23.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the same, we'll have\Nto conduct an investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.43,0:16:25.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There's no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.23,0:16:26.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If there was even a remote possibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.83,0:16:28.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we would've conducted one a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:35.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:40.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I put the address of the place I'm\Nheading next in your external memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.01,0:16:43.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If I don't come back...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.51,0:16:44.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,try looking for me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.81,0:16:46.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.01,0:16:48.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're okay going alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:50.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.71,0:18:27.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.89,0:18:33.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, as I thought,\Nyou've forgotten all about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.59,0:18:37.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it was only five years ago\Nthat I was living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.29,0:18:41.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When did you take over that woman's body?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.69,0:18:43.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Three months ago or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.19,0:18:46.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I accidentally spotted you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.09,0:18:49.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You didn't notice me at all, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:52.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What about that woman's\Ncybernetic cranial core?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.19,0:18:53.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.49,0:18:56.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It may be on Dream Island by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.39,0:18:59.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You got my fingerprints from\Nthat bar, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.59,0:19:03.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why did you try to become me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:11.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I... I could not understand\Nthe reason why you disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:14.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It wasn't as though you found another woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:17.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,nor as though you didn't like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.75,0:19:22.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I was told not to ask anything\Nabout you, so I did just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.85,0:19:26.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But you still disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.75,0:19:32.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you remember the first\Nthing you told me when we met?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.55,0:19:36.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"I don't sleep with the same woman twice."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.05,0:19:40.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At first, I thought, "What the hell?"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:43.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But the second time around,\NI was already hooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.35,0:19:46.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It must have been the same thing for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What a cruel man you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.95,0:19:52.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hated you until I was at the brink of insanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.45,0:19:57.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Still, I continued to think about\Nthe reason why you disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.05,0:20:00.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And that's why you got the face?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.95,0:20:01.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.85,0:20:03.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did you find out anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.85,0:20:08.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The depth... of the love you feel... towards me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.05,0:20:15.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You and I... were looking\Nfor totally different worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.55,0:20:21.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You disappeared...\Nso as to not let me see your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:23.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't give me too much credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.35,0:20:25.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.15,0:20:27.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's the kind of person you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:30.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But I don't care anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.65,0:20:34.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I now have your ghost within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:39.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So... I don't need the real you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.17,0:20:57.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you still have any love for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:59.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,die... here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.27,0:21:02.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sure, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.27,0:21:05.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you're the one who kills\Nme, I wouldn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.03,0:21:20.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're going after them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.03,0:21:22.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.14,0:21:53.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did you get her?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.07,0:22:15.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, the specific details are as reported.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.57,0:22:17.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sounds like a Pazu type of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.35,0:22:18.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.97,0:22:23.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In any case, don't you think he\Nshould've noticed who it was sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.47,0:22:25.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.87,0:22:29.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There may be a surprising number\Nof women who want to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.27,0:22:31.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.77,0:22:33.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never checked it out myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.77,0:22:36.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but when I first went to recruit him,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.47,0:22:40.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,he said something like, "I never\Nsleep with the same woman twice", too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.97,0:22:41.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.67,0:22:43.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.96,0:22:48.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,More importantly, that Pazu\Nhad better be the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:51.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.61,0:23:11.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.23,0:23:14.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.14,0:23:17.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.82,0:23:21.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.62,0:23:25.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:28.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.28,0:23:32.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.86,0:23:34.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.07,0:23:36.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.15,0:23:38.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.60,0:23:40.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.46,0:23:41.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.94,0:23:44.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside (Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.49,0:23:46.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.34,0:23:49.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
